        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The brass dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Flame** (arcane, evocation, fire) The dragon breathes fire in a 100-foot line that deals 16d6 fire damage (39 basic Reflex save).\n- **Sleep Gas** (arcane, enchantment, incapacitation, sleep); The dragon breathes an 80-foot cone of sleep gas. Each creature within the cone must succeed at a 39 Fortitude save or fall unconscious for 1d6 rounds, or 1 minute on a critical failure."
            },
